001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.          TUSRCVR.
001300 AUTHOR.              C HILLES.
001400 DATE-WRITTEN.        3/7/79.
001500 DATE-COMPILED.
001600*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
001700*SECURITY.
001800*
001900*REMARKS.  THIS PROGRAM WILL UPDATE THE USAGE FILE FROM ANY FILE
001910*          THAT IS IN THE FORMAT OF "USYESFIL".
001920*
      *C   07MAR1994    DAVE PLUM
      *C     ADDED CALL TO THE COBOL ERROR HANDLER - MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C  11/25/97    JEFF BUNGO   REQ #97-017
      *C     ADD USAGE FIELDS FOR DIRECT DELIVERY.  DD USAGE
      *C     TO BE STORED IN ADDITIONAL FIELD AND TOTAL USAGE.
      *C     STORE ISSUE USAGE CALCULATED BY TOTAL USAGE - DD USAGE.
      *C
002000 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002100 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002200 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
002300 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
002700 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
002800 FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT USED-YEST-FILE ASSIGN TO DISK-MCFPUSYEST.

           SELECT USAGEFIL-CD-O
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCSUSAG
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

003200 DATA DIVISION.
003300 FILE SECTION.
      *------ FD STATEMENT AREA FOR IBM ONLY ------*
       FD  USAGEFIL-CD-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  USAGEFIL-CD-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCSUSAG  OF MCFLCSUSAG.

      *------ FD STATEMENT AREA FOR IBM ONLY ------*
003400
003500 FD  USED-YEST-FILE
003600     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
003700     RECORD CONTAINS 18 CHARACTERS
003800     DATA RECORD IS USED-YEST-RCD.
003900 01  USED-YEST-RCD.
004000     05  USED-YEST-CODE       PIC X(8).
004100     05  USED-YEST-QTY        PIC S9(8).
004200     05  USED-YEST-MONTH      PIC 9(2).
004300
004400 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
004500  77  USAGE-CNTR                  PIC 9(4)  VALUE 0.
004600  77  SAVE-MTD                    PIC S9(8)  VALUE 0.
004600  77  SAVE-MTD-AFTER              PIC S9(8)  VALUE 0.
004610  77  FORMAT-SAVE-MTD             PIC --------9.
004620  77  FORMAT-USED-YEST-QTY        PIC --------9.
004630  77  FORMAT-K-MTH-USAGE          PIC --------9.
        77  MCXCBLERR-SCOPE             PIC X(1)   VALUE "C".
004700
        COPY DBSTAT IN COPYLIB.
004800**************************************************************
004900**                                                          **
005000**       D A T E / T I M E   A R E A S                      **
005100**                                                          **
005200**************************************************************
       COPY TDATECHK IN COPYLIB.
       COPY TBLOWUP  IN COPYLIB.
005300
006000 01  YMD-SHORT.
006100     05  YY-SHORT      PIC XX.
006200     05  MM-SHORT      PIC XX.
006300     05  DD-SHORT      PIC XX.
006400 01  CURRENT-MONTH-9   PIC 9(2)  VALUE 0.

006500**************************************************************
006600**                                                          **
006700**               K S A M   W O R K                          **
006800**                                                          **
006900**************************************************************
007000
007100 01  CODE-ARG                      PIC X(8)  VALUE SPACES.
007200 01  KEY-LOC                       PIC S9(4) BINARY VALUE 3.
007300 01  RECSIZE                       PIC S9(4) BINARY VALUE 66.
007400 01  RESULT                        PIC 9(4)  VALUE ZEROS.
007500 01  LOCK-COND                    PIC S9(4)  BINARY VALUE 1.
007600 01  BUF-USAGEFIL.
007700     05  FILLER                   PIC XX.
007800     05  K-CORP-CODE              PIC X(8).
007900     05  K-MONTHS                 OCCURS 14 TIMES.
008000         10  K-MTH-USAGE          PIC S9(9) BINARY.
007900     05  K-MONTHS-DD              OCCURS 14 TIMES.
008000         10  K-MTH-USAGE-DD       PIC S9(9) BINARY.
008100
008200 01  FILETABLE.
008300     05  FILENUMBER               PIC S9(4) BINARY VALUE 0.
008400     05  FILENAME                 PIC X(8)  VALUE "USAGEFIL".
008500     05  I-O-TYPE                 PIC S9(4) BINARY VALUE 2.
008600     05  A-MODE                   PIC S9(4) BINARY VALUE 1.
008700     05  PREV-OP                  PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 0.
008800
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".
009200
009300**********************
009400*                    *
009500* PROCEDURE DIVISION *
009600*                    *
009700**********************
009800
009900 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
010000 1-START.
           MOVE "C" TO MCXCBLERR-SCOPE.
           CALL "MCXCBLERR" USING MCXCBLERR-SCOPE.

           CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA.
           MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT  TO  YMD-SHORT.
010500     MOVE MM-SHORT  TO  CURRENT-MONTH-9.
           PERFORM 9999-OPEN-STUFF.
011100     OPEN INPUT USED-YEST-FILE.

011200 8-UPDATE-USAGE-FILE.
           PERFORM 9930-LOCK.
011700
011800 8-UPDATE-USAGE-LOOP.
011900
012000**************************************************************
012100**   HERE, WE UPDATE THE MONTHLY USAGE FILE "USAGEFIL".     **
012200**************************************************************
012300
012400     READ USED-YEST-FILE AT END
012500         CLOSE USED-YEST-FILE
012600         GO TO 8-UNLOCK-USAGE-FILE.
012700
012800     MOVE USED-YEST-CODE       TO   CODE-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-DBGET7-USAGEFIL-CD-O.
013400
013600     IF USED-YEST-MONTH = CURRENT-MONTH-9
               MOVE K-MTH-USAGE (13) TO   SAVE-MTD
013700         ADD USED-YEST-QTY     TO   K-MTH-USAGE (13)
               MOVE K-MTH-USAGE (13) TO   SAVE-MTD-AFTER
013800     ELSE
               MOVE K-MTH-USAGE (USED-YEST-MONTH) TO SAVE-MTD
013900         ADD USED-YEST-QTY     TO   K-MTH-USAGE (USED-YEST-MONTH)
               MOVE K-MTH-USAGE (USED-YEST-MONTH) TO SAVE-MTD-AFTER.
014000     ADD USED-YEST-QTY         TO   K-MTH-USAGE (14).
           PERFORM 9999-DBUPDATE-USAGEFIL-CD-O.
014600
014700     ADD 1 TO USAGE-CNTR.
014800
013600     IF USED-YEST-MONTH = CURRENT-MONTH-9
014810     MOVE SAVE-MTD                 TO  FORMAT-SAVE-MTD.
014820     MOVE USED-YEST-QTY            TO  FORMAT-USED-YEST-QTY.
014830     MOVE SAVE-MTD-AFTER           TO  FORMAT-K-MTH-USAGE.
014900     DISPLAY "CODE ", CODE-ARG, " WAS UPDATED FROM ",
015000       FORMAT-SAVE-MTD, "       BY ",
015100       FORMAT-USED-YEST-QTY, "       TO ", FORMAT-K-MTH-USAGE.
015200
015300     GO TO 8-UPDATE-USAGE-LOOP.
015400
015500 8-UNLOCK-USAGE-FILE.
015600     DISPLAY "* ", USAGE-CNTR, " USAGES UPDATED *".
           PERFORM 9940-UNLOCK.
016100
016200 8-STOP-RUN.
           PERFORM 9999-CLOSE-STUFF.
           GOBACK.

       2100-BLOWUP.
           DISPLAY "FATAL ERROR, FILE-STATUS = ", FILE-STATUS.
           GOBACK.

016400 4-KSAM-ERROR.
           DISPLAY "ERROR, FILE-STATUS = ", FILE-STATUS.
017000
       9930-LOCK.

       9940-UNLOCK.

       9999-DBGET7-USAGEFIL-CD-O.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE CODE-ARG TO CORPCDE OF USAGEFIL-CD-REC-O.
           READ USAGEFIL-CD-O INTO BUF-USAGEFIL
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "23"
               MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBGET7 ERR 9999-DBGET7-USAGEFIL-CD-O"
                   TO BU-MSG-AREA
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

       9999-RESET-USAGEFIL-CD-O.
           MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO CORPCDE OF USAGEFIL-CD-REC-O.
           START USAGEFIL-CD-O KEY > CORPCDE OF USAGEFIL-CD-REC-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO FILE-STATUS.

       9999-DBUPDATE-USAGEFIL-CD-O.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           REWRITE USAGEFIL-CD-REC-O FROM BUF-USAGEFIL
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBUPDATE ERR 9999-DBUPDATE-USAGEFIL-CD-O"
                   TO BU-MSG-AREA
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

       9999-OPEN-STUFF.
           OPEN I-O   USAGEFIL-CD-O                              .

       9999-CLOSE-STUFF.
           CLOSE      USAGEFIL-CD-O                              .
